  "contentHtml": "<div><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"padding: 10px; border: 3px double rgb(254, 137, 67); background-color: rgb(254, 222, 199);\"><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\"></span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHv%26dataid%3D1200%26fileid%3D5%26regdt%3D20150527230103&url=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile283.uf.daum.net%2Fattach%2F232C723D5565CE050B93DA')\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/daumtop_deco/icon/icon.hanmail.net/editor/p_hwp_s.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"첨부파일\" class=\"vam\"/> 달의 크기(캐릭터).hwp</a></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">&lt;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&gt;의 수업관련자료들은 선생님들의 '협업'을 위해 공유되고 있습니다. </span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">수업을 위한 자료로만 사용해주시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><b><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 11pt;\">** '말머리' 에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요. </span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.**</span></span></b></p></div><p><!--StartFragment--></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">김신혜 선생님이 소개해주신 자료를 보고 바로 적용해보았네요</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">..</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">자료를 공유해달라는 분이 몇몇 계셔서 파일 올려드립니다. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">.</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">저희 딸이 소개시켜준 캐릭터</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">뽀로로</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">도라에몽</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">짱구</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">패티</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">둘리</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">) </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">중 </span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">3</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">개를 선택해서 얼굴의 세로크기를 측정하는 미션을 하였는데 </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->&nbsp;</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">생각보다 오차가 작게 났어요</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">... </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">캐릭터 크기는 플로터로 뽑아 세로 크기가 대략 </span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">40 Cm</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">정도의 크기로 했네요</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">....</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->&nbsp;</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">심지어 어떤 반은 </span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">0.2cm </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">오차밖에 나지 않아 모두 신기해 했네요</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">...</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->&nbsp;</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">종이에 구멍을 뚫는 것도 세가지</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">대</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">중</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">소</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">를 골라서 마음대로 해보라고 했습니다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--></span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><font face=\"함초롬바탕\">&nbsp;</font>대부분 (중)을 선택하네요</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">...</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->&nbsp;</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">그리고 오차분석을 몇몇반에서는 했는데</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.. </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">대부분 줄자를 똑바로 재지 않아 생기는 부분과 눈과 종이의 구멍사이의 거리 측정을 정확하게 하지 않는 것에서 많이 나네요</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">...</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">필요하신 분이 계실것 같아서 캐릭터는 공유합니다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">덕분에 재미있는 수업이 되었습니다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.  </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">감사합니다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 한컴바탕;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2771E83D5565CD7B30\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"696\" height=\"487\" style=\"width: 696px; height: 487px; clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"4.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"1024\"  id=\"A_2771E83D5565CD7B303DD0\"/></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 한컴바탕;\"></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/252C723D5565CD7B08\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"690\" height=\"469\" style=\"width: 690px; height: 469px; clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"3.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"1024\"  id=\"A_252C723D5565CD7B08F3B1\"/></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 한컴바탕;\"></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/227FA13D5565CD7C1E\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"687\" height=\"510\" style=\"width: 687px; height: 510px; clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"2.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"1024\"  id=\"A_227FA13D5565CD7C1E7773\"/></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 한컴바탕;\"></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/223A4B3F5565CDED37\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"647\" height=\"454\" style=\"width: 647px; height: 454px; clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"1.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"580\"  id=\"A_223A4B3F5565CDED3704BE\"/></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 한컴바탕;\"> </span></p></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
